+2. Extract this ZIP into a fresh folder.
+3. On macOS, double-click `START_INQUISITIO_MAC.command`. On Windows, use `START_INQUISITIO_WINDOWS.bat`. Python 3.11 or newer is required; the first launch installs the declared Python dependencies.
