-2. Extracts page-level passages and structured facts from uploaded PDFs.
-3. Builds an internal requirement for all 81 Form 202 items and all 55 Form 207 items.
-4. Populates supported or partial drafts when an exact, reliable, correctly attributed fact is available.
-5. Preserves exact quotations, PDF page numbers, source identifiers, and document SHA-256 hashes.
