-## macOS source launch
+- pdfplumber retains lines, table cells and short values. PyMuPDF layout blocks handle fragmented or out-of-order extraction.
+- pypdf reads interactive widget values and inherited field values.
+- A selected-form target list covers all 81 Form 202 fields and all 55 Form 207 fields. Values are linked to the responding party across nearby blocks with name-variant matching.
+- Dates retain their original text and a normalized value. Address spelling variants are consolidated without combining different addresses.
+- OCRmyPDF runs locally on image-only pages and missing scanned entries beside printed labels. Local pytesseract is the fallback. OCR citations are marked. OCR errors are retained in document metadata.
+- Classification changes source confidence rather than excluding explicit facts.
+- Medical events are linked to their provider and date; the latest visit is not replaced by a birth date or a future scheduled appointment.
+- No LLM or cloud service is used for matter processing.
 
