-- TC-001: Create Form 207 matter with a confirmed plaintiff respondent and a payroll PDF. Actual: one `SUPPORTED_DRAFT`, 45 `CLIENT_CONFIRMATION`, nine `NO_RESPONSIVE_EVIDENCE`; exact $1,450 answer and one citation. Pass.
