-## 7. Defects, Risks, and Limitations
-
-- BLOCK-001: Browser UAT not executed. Cause: registry HTTP 403 and absent browser runtime. Retest on a permitted environment using `packaging/run_browser_uat.sh`.
-- BLOCK-002: Native macOS `.app`, signing, notarization, and macOS launch were not built or tested in Linux. Retest through the included macOS workflow.
-- RISK-001: OCR is not implemented. Image-only or severely malformed extraction stays unresolved.
-- RISK-002: Deterministic extraction recognizes a conservative set of explicit formulations. Many otherwise answerable natural-language records will require confirmation or manual drafting.
-- RISK-003: No independent attorney-labeled evidence packet was supplied, so the directive's 95% answerable-question accuracy target is not independently established.
-
-## 8. Acceptance Record
-
-**Decision: Rejected pending correction.**
-
-The source implementation and executed regression suite are internally consistent, locally runnable, and materially improve evidence-grounded drafting. The directive's definition of done is not fully demonstrated because actual browser UAT, native macOS packaging, and independent accuracy validation remain incomplete. Do not distribute this source ZIP as a finished, signed macOS GUI release.
